---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Async Workflow Audit",
  "serviceType": "AI / Operations Consulting",
  "provider": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Pravine Manivannan", "url": "https://pravinemani.com/" },
  "areaServed": "Worldwide",
  "description": "Free async workflow audit. Send a Loom or written brief. Get a 1-page written audit in 48 hours: where the leak is, the 3 highest-leverage automations, rough cost / time-to-ship estimates.",
  "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "CAD" },
  "url": "https://pravinemani.com/workflow-audit/"
};
---

<Base title="Free Async Workflow Audit · 48-Hour Written Response · Pravine Mani" description="Send a Loom or written brief of one workflow. Get a 1-page written audit back in 48 hours. Free. No sales call. The 3 highest-leverage automations, where to start, where to skip, rough cost to ship." jsonLd={jsonLd}>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><span class="gr">$</span> ./audit --async --free --48h</div>
  <h1>Send a workflow.<br><span class="accent">Get a written audit in 48 hours. Free.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Free async audit for founders, agency owners, and ops leads. Send a Loom or short brief, and you'll get back a one-page written response within 48 hours: the three highest-leverage automations in the workflow, where to start, what to skip, rough cost and timeline. No sales call attached.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="how-grid">
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-step">01.</div>
      <h3>Send the workflow</h3>
      <p>Send a five-minute Loom walking through one workflow, or a short written brief if recording is friction. Include the current stack and the part that costs the most time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-step">02.</div>
      <h3>I write the audit</h3>
      <p>A one-page written response inside 48 hours: the three highest-leverage automations ranked, stack-specific recommendations, what not to automate, and rough cost and ship-time estimates.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-step">03.</div>
      <h3>You decide what's next</h3>
      <p>If one of the three is worth shipping and the fit is right, the natural next step is the paid Audit or a Sprint. Or you take the written audit and build it yourself. Both are valid uses of the format.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="audit-form-wrap reveal">
    <div class="intake-head">
      <div class="label">async audit · 5 fields · ~5 minutes to send</div>
      <h2>Send your workflow.</h2>
      <p>The form below submits directly to my inbox. I read every submission personally and reply within 48 hours on weekdays. There is no follow-up sequence, no mailing list signup, and no automated sales outreach attached to the audit.</p>
    </div>

    <form class="intake-form" action="/api/contact" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Async Workflow Audit Request · pravinemani.com" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_form" value="workflow-audit" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_honey" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="/workflow-audit/?sent=1" />

      <div class="intake-row">
        <label for="name">Your name + company</label>
        <input id="name" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="e.g. Jane Doe, Acme Co." />
      </div>

      <div class="intake-row">
        <label for="email">Email for the audit reply</label>
        <input id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" />
      </div>

      <div class="intake-row">
        <label for="loom">Loom URL or short workflow description</label>
        <textarea id="loom" name="workflow" rows="4" required placeholder="Paste a Loom URL, OR describe one workflow in 3-5 sentences. Examples: lead intake from FB Lead Ads, monthly client reporting, content scheduling, prospect enrichment, etc."></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="intake-row">
        <label for="stack">Current stack on that workflow</label>
        <textarea id="stack" name="stack" rows="2" required placeholder="e.g. HubSpot + Zapier + Google Sheets. Or: Notion + manual email. Or: Make + Airtable + Slack. List whatever the workflow touches."></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="intake-row">
        <label for="pain">The most painful part of this workflow</label>
        <textarea id="pain" name="pain" rows="2" placeholder="One sentence. The part that costs you the most time, or where leads / data / money leaks. Optional but helps."></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="intake-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="btn intake-submit">Send for audit →</button>
        <span class="intake-foot">48-hour reply window. Toronto / ET. No spam, no list, no sales sequence.</span>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div class="title-block">
      <div class="label">qualifier · who this is for</div>
      <h2>Best fit for these four buyer types.</h2>
      <p>If you do not match one of these, the written audit will probably not produce the kind of recommendation that's worth shipping. Read before sending.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fit-grid">
    <div class="fit-card good">
      <div class="lab">GOOD FIT</div>
      <h4>SaaS founder, 1-15 people</h4>
      <p>The team is running operations manually that the product itself should be automating. The opportunity is visible, but there is no internal engineer with the capacity to ship the automation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card good">
      <div class="lab">GOOD FIT</div>
      <h4>Agency owner, under 10 people</h4>
      <p>A specific workflow is consuming client-delivery margin. Common cases: client reporting, content production, lead enrichment, QA review pipelines.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card good">
      <div class="lab">GOOD FIT</div>
      <h4>Tech-forward SMB</h4>
      <p>The business is already running on a modern stack (Vercel, Supabase, or equivalent) rather than relying primarily on no-code platforms. The workflow is a candidate for owned code rather than an additional Zapier dependency.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card good">
      <div class="lab">GOOD FIT</div>
      <h4>Ops lead inside a Series A/B company</h4>
      <p>The engineering team is committed to product work. You own the operations stack and want an external written assessment before proposing the build internally.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fit-grid" style="margin-top: 14px;">
    <div class="fit-card bad">
      <div class="lab">NOT A FIT</div>
      <h4>Pre-revenue solo founder</h4>
      <p>At pre-revenue stage, the audit recommendation is almost always to focus on shipping the product before investing in operations automation. Review the engagement shapes at /services/ to understand the timing better.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card bad">
      <div class="lab">NOT A FIT</div>
      <h4>50+ person organization with internal engineering</h4>
      <p>A one-page external audit cannot represent the full surface area of an organization at that size. The internal engineering team is better positioned to scope and own the work directly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card bad">
      <div class="lab">NOT A FIT</div>
      <h4>"Broken Zapier" repair work</h4>
      <p>The audit recommends code-first rebuilds rather than fixes to existing no-code platforms. If the workflow only makes sense on Zapier and the priority is to keep it there, the engagement is not the right match.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-card bad">
      <div class="lab">NOT A FIT</div>
      <h4>Marketing strategy audit</h4>
      <p>The format is an operations and workflow audit. It does not cover positioning, copywriting, brand strategy, or paid-advertising review. Those are different engagements that require different specialists.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="vert-cta reveal" style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="lab" style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">ALTERNATIVE</div>
    <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 32px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 14px;">Already know you want to scope a build?</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 18px;">If the engagement shape is already clear, the free <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--green); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);">30-minute scoping call</a> is the faster path to a written quote.</p>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>

<style is:global>
.how-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .how-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.how-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 28px 30px; position: relative; }
.how-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
.how-step { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.how-card h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(20px, 1.6vw, 26px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.012em; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.how-card p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

.audit-form-wrap { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 32px 36px; position: relative; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; }
.audit-form-wrap::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--green); opacity: 0.85; }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .audit-form-wrap { padding: 24px 22px; } }

.intake-head { margin-bottom: 24px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.intake-head .label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.intake-head h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 36px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.018em; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.intake-head p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 64ch; }

.intake-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
.intake-form input[name="_honey"] { display: none !important; }
.intake-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.intake-row label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.intake-row input, .intake-row textarea {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  background: var(--bg-tertiary);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 12px 14px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color var(--dur-micro, 150ms) var(--ease);
}
.intake-row input:focus, .intake-row textarea:focus { border-color: var(--green); }
.intake-row input::placeholder, .intake-row textarea::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
.intake-row textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.55; }

.intake-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 6px; }
.intake-submit { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 14px 24px; background: var(--green); color: var(--bg-primary); border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--dur-micro, 150ms) var(--ease); }
.intake-submit:hover { background: var(--text-primary); }
.intake-foot { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); }

.fit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
@media (max-width: 1100px) { .fit-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .fit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.fit-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.fit-card .lab { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fit-card.good { border-left: 2px solid var(--green); }
.fit-card.good .lab { color: var(--green); }
.fit-card.bad { border-left: 2px solid var(--red); opacity: 0.75; }
.fit-card.bad .lab { color: var(--red); }
.fit-card h4 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25; }
.fit-card p { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; }

.vert-cta { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-green); padding: 36px 32px; position: relative; }
.vert-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center top, rgba(0,255,65,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
.vert-cta > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
</style>

<script>
  if (window.location.search.includes('sent=1')) {
    const wrap = document.querySelector('.audit-form-wrap');
    if (wrap) {
      const banner = document.createElement('div');
      banner.style.cssText = 'background: var(--bg-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--green); border-left: 2px solid var(--green); padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-primary);';
      banner.textContent = 'Workflow received. I read every one personally. Written audit reply within 48 hours on weekdays.';
      wrap.prepend(banner);
    }
  }
</script>
